/**
 * @mainpage ArgusAI - Object Detection and Segmentation System
 *
 * @section intro_sec Introduction
 * ArgusAI is an advanced AI-powered object detection and segmentation system
 * designed for real-time image analysis. The system leverages state-of-the-art
 * deep learning techniques to provide precise object detection and segmentation.
 *
 * @section features_sec Key Features
 * - Real-time object detection
 * - Semantic segmentation
 * - Multiple AI model support
 * - React-based user interface
 * - RESTful API
 * - Multi-language support (English and Polish)
 *
 * @section arch_sec Architecture
 * The system consists of the following main components:
 * - @ref backend "Backend" - API server and processing logic
 * - @ref frontend "Frontend" - User interface
 * - @ref models "AI Models" - Pre-trained models
 *
 * @section install_sec Installation
 * Detailed installation instructions can be found in the @ref installation "Installation" section.
 *
 * @section usage_sec Usage
 * To get started with the system:
 * 1. Install all dependencies
 * 2. Start the backend server
 * 3. Launch the frontend application
 * 4. Open your browser and navigate to http://localhost:3000
 *
 * @section api_sec API Documentation
 * Complete API documentation is available in the @ref api "API Documentation" section.
 *
 * @section contrib_sec Contributing
 * We welcome contributions to the project. Please review our contribution
 * guidelines before submitting a pull request.
 *
 * @section license_sec License
 * The project is released under the MIT license. Details can be found in the LICENSE file.
 */ 